    "summary": "Use it in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) on 1 **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit of yours that has not yet been **selected to shoot** or fight this phase. Choose 1 ability; until the phase ends, weapons its models are equipped with have it:\n\n- **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**\n- **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**\n\nMeanwhile, its models can target only **PSYKER** units.",
